{"id":"3b78fd5923bcaa6c","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-sigma-one-completeness.md","title":"Sigma-One Completeness of PA","display":"thm-sigma-one-completeness — Sigma-One Completeness of PA","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-sigma-one-completeness","aliases":["89-thm-sigma-one-completeness"],"display":"thm-sigma-one-completeness — Sigma-One Completeness of PA","depends_on":["[[89-df-sigma-one-formula]]","[[89-df-open-provability-formula]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-sigma-one-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-sigma-one-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sigma-one-completeness — Sigma-One Completeness of PA"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"571230a8af3bcd56\" href=\"?note=571230a8af3bcd56\" title=\"89-df-sigma-one-formula\">89-df-sigma-one-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f748d191ce42f6ef\" href=\"?note=f748d191ce42f6ef\" title=\"89-df-open-provability-formula\">89-df-open-provability-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(S\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(\\bar x)\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\">\\(F(\\bar x)\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bew}[F](\\bar x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Bew}[F](\\bar x)\\)</span> 为开放数词实例可证性公式。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\models S\">\\(\\mathbb N\\models S\\)</span> 是外部标准真；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span> 为固定经典演算。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}one\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathbb N\\models S\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}S,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}F(\\bar x)\\to\\mathrm{Bew}[F](\\bar x).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}one\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathbb N\\models S\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}S,\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}F(\\bar x)\\to\\mathrm{Bew}[F](\\bar x).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 2 章，印刷页 25–26,46–49；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n第一项是外部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 完备性，第二项是其内部化。原书先验证五种数值原子，否定等式先转换为严格 Σ 等价式，再按严格 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 生成归纳：真存在式取实际数词见证；有界全称式仅涉及有限多个实例，并编码它们的证明；布尔组合通过证明拼接处理。将这些编码变换在 PA 中表示得内部式，最后经 PA 可证等价扩展到显示的公式类。编码变换的细节见原书所引证明，未在此机械展开。\n这不是对所有算术真句子的完备性；PA 可靠性与 PA 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 完备性也不是同一个条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-sigma-one-formula","status":"resolved","id":"571230a8af3bcd56","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-sigma-one-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-open-provability-formula","status":"resolved","id":"f748d191ce42f6ef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-open-provability-formula]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"F(\\bar x)\\in\\Sigma^{\\mathrm{PA}}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bew}[F](\\bar x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N\\models S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}sigma\\text{-}one\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathbb N\\models S\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}S,\\\\\n&\\mathrm{PA}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}F(\\bar x)\\to\\mathrm{Bew}[F](\\bar x).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false}],"bytes":1763,"backlinks":[{"id":"2adc36a611449e23","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"453434df21a27b52","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-34","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-language]] → [[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]] → [[89-df-peano-arithmetic]] → [[89-df-provability-predicate]] → [[89-df-sigma-one-formula]] → [[89-thm-sigma-one-completeness]] → [[89-thm-pa-derivability-conditions]]"}],"outgoing":["571230a8af3bcd56","f748d191ce42f6ef"]}